README.md:52: This keeps resources editable in place: `extensions/`, `skills/`, `prompts/`, `themes/`, `agents/`, `APPEND_SYSTEM.md`, and the top-level prompt/playbook files are all loaded from the checkout. Runtime state such as `auth.json`, `settings.json`, sessions, run history, tracker state, and generated worktrees is ignored by git.
README.md:95: `extensions/github-tracker.ts` exposes tab completion for `/gh-track`, `/gh-issue`, `/gh-work`, and `/gh-labels` subcommands. It also completes `/gh-track projects <status|enable|disable|on|off>`, `/gh-issue stage <number> <stage>`, `/gh-work pane <mode>`, and `/gh-work done --close`.
